        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/rabit/{size}/7330_2.png",
        "created_at": "2017-04-22T12:13:49.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p><font color=\"green\"><span class=\"bbcode-b\">This thread has been locked to prevent it from spiralling further out of control.&nbsp;<span></span></span></font></p>\n<p><span><font color=\"green\"><span class=\"bbcode-b\"></span>Thank you to the voices promoting civil discourse and offering questions to promote conversation.&nbsp;<span></span></font></span></p>\n<p><span><font color=\"green\"><span class=\"bbcode-b\"></span>I’ll ask everyone to remember we do have the&nbsp;<a href=\"https://greaterthangames.com/forum/topic/official-forum-rules\">the forum rules</a><span>, and – while it doesn’t happen often – we <em>will </em>step in to enforce them.&nbsp;</span><span>Per rule <span class=\"hashtag\">#13</span>, if you see a situation that you feel is trolling, please do not respond to that effect on that thread, as it will only make matters worse. Please contact one or (preferrably) more of the Mods / Admins and ask for their assistance. Feel free to participate in civil and constructive conversation, of course!  <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/slightly_smiling_face.png?v=9\" title=\":slightly_smiling_face:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slightly_smiling_face:\"> &nbsp;</span></font></span></p>",
